---
---
<!-- SECTION: HOW WE MAKE THE CONNECTIONS (THE CLINICAL CONNECTION MODEL) -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-brand-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orchid/10 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-extrabold text-brand-orchid">
        <span aria-hidden="true">✨</span> Simple 4-Step Family Journey
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-3">
        How We Connect Your Family with a Playful Clinical Duo
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
        Unlike traditional clinics that assign whoever happens to be free, we hand-match complete <strong
          class="text-brand-dark">2-person clinical teams</strong
        > based on your neighbourhood, your child's play interests, and developmental goals.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step-by-Step 4 Phase Playful Journey Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="card-playful scroll-reveal relative bg-brand-surface/70 p-6 sm:p-7 border-2 border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
            <span
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-orchid text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-glow-orchid"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              🧩
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-brand-border text-xs font-extrabold text-brand-orchid">
              Step 01
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Share Your Child's Spark</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Tell us about your child's favourite toys, sensory profile, communication goals, school routine, and OAP status.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border/60 text-xs font-bold text-brand-orchid flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>⏱️ Takes just 2 minutes</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="card-playful scroll-reveal relative bg-brand-surface/70 p-6 sm:p-7 border-2 border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
            <span
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-ocean text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-glow-ocean"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              🤝
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-brand-border text-xs font-extrabold text-brand-ocean">
              Step 02
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Meet Your Clinical Duo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            We match you with a warm local Instructor Therapist already paired with a licensed Supervising R.B.A. (Ont.).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border/60 text-xs font-bold text-brand-ocean flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>📍 In your own neighbourhood</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="card-playful scroll-reveal relative bg-brand-surface/70 p-6 sm:p-7 border-2 border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
            <span
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-berry text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-md"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              💬
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-brand-border text-xs font-extrabold text-brand-berry">
              Step 03
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Free Family Vibe-Check</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Chat with your team on a friendly video call. Review your child's playful goals and make sure the fit feels 100% right.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border/60 text-xs font-bold text-brand-berry flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>💛 Zero pressure to commit</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="card-playful scroll-reveal relative bg-brand-surface/70 p-6 sm:p-7 border-2 border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
            <span
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-amethyst text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-md"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              🏡
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-brand-border text-xs font-extrabold text-brand-amethyst">
              Step 04
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Playful Sessions Begin!</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            1-on-1 play-based learning starts in your living room with live R.B.A. supervision and OAP-ready invoices.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border/60 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>✓ CPBAO Standard 4 Compliant</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Banner: Old Bureaucratic Way vs. Side by Side Connect -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="card-playful bg-rose-50/50 border-2 border-rose-200/80 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl bg-rose-200/80 text-rose-800 flex items-center justify-center font-extrabold text-base" aria-hidden="true"
            >✕</span
          >
          <div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-700">What Families Leave Behind</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-rose-950">The Old Agency Runaround</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-rose-900/90 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Months stuck on impersonal waitlists without knowing who will work with your child.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span
              >Outdated "tiered" models where middle-managers—not licensed R.B.A.s—oversee therapy (prohibited under CPBAO Standard 4.9).</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Frequent staff turnover that disrupts your child's trust, comfort, and daily routine.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card-playful brand-gradient-soft border-2 border-brand-orchid/40 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl brand-gradient text-white flex items-center justify-center font-extrabold text-base shadow-sm"
            aria-hidden="true"
            >✓</span
          >
          <div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-orchid">Why Families Love Us</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-dark">The Side by Side Connection</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-800 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-extrabold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span
              >Meet your dedicated Instructor Therapist &amp; Supervising R.B.A. (Ont.) before your very first session.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-extrabold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span
              >Direct CPBAO Standard 4.4 Supervision Agreement from day one—no middlemen, ever.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-brand-orchid font-extrabold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span>Warm, joyful, child-led sessions right in your living room, backyard, or neighbourhood park.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
